 e before the victory tenth.\n\nStory: Sharad Navratri begins Ashvina Shukl
 a Pratipada — nine nights of Devi\, culminating toward Dussehra.\nSource
 : Devi Mahatmya (Markandeya Purana)\nWhy: a structured nine-day arc of dis
 cipline\, song and courage before the victory tenth.\nModern angle: Multi-
 day ritual structure aids habit and belonging\; cultural/psychological.\nE
 vidence: Cultural/psychological\nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dha
